RS232/RS485/CAN/Direct GPIO
---------------------------

The product provides the following serial and CAN interfaces:

- 2 x RS232 **(default)**; up to 4 x RS232 (**optional**, by configuring RS485 to RS232)
- 2 x RS485 **(default)**; 2 x RS485 can be configured to 2 x RS232 **(optional)**
- 1 x CAN **(default)**

